**Updating hostName across pairing and mobile layers**

I've added hostName to PairingSessionResponse in pairing.rs and ensured it compiles by updating desktop's pairing.rs accordingly. On mobile, the PairingPayload now includes hostName, and local_storage's ConnectionRecord handles hostName in JSON serialization. I'm also tracking the updated _recordManualConnection method signature and its usage in main.dart to reflect the new hostName parameter.
