thinking
**Deciding to update lockfile**

Updating Cargo.lock is necessary after adding dependencies to ensure consistency; running `cargo build` will update the lockfile properly despite taking more time.
thinking
**Confirming desktop build skip and updating mobile schema**

Decided to update Cargo.lock by running desktop build only if needed to avoid uncommitted changes, but prioritizing running tests first. Also updated mobile database schema version and adjusted ConnectionRecord usage in mobile code and tests, now planning to search for all ConnectionRecord usages to fix constructor calls.
